# a kit's EDIT pages: a black key picks the key shown (and plays it, stopped); the white keys put it on the bar's
# steps (a tap: at its release), again takes it off, as Steps does; held, the knobs lock the page's knobs on the step
# (the key put on it if it has not), and the release toggles nothing. With EDIT held, or recording, the keys play
wait 300
expect trk 1
tap EDIT
expect page Engine
tapkey b1
expect note 1 1 6 0
tapkey w5
expect note 1 1 6 2
tapkey w5
expect note 1 1 6 0
turn SELECT 1
wait 40
tapkey w7
expect note 1 1 8 2
press EDIT
tapkey w9
release EDIT
expect note 1 1 10 0
turn SELECT -1
wait 40
key w11 down
wait 100
turn K1 5
wait 800
key w11 up
expect note 1 1 12 2
expect lane 1 1 d2.k1 1
key w13 down
wait 900
key w13 up
expect note 1 1 14 0
shot kitedit.png
